10	 * Create-time daily-limit guard for {@code POST /owners}: rejects a request once 100 or more owners
11	 * have already been registered on the request's effective business day (by {@code registrationDate}),
12	 * with a 429 via {@link DailyOwnerLimitException}.
13	 *
14	 * <p>The effective business day is the supplied registration date, or the server date when omitted,
15	 * rolled forward over a weekend to Monday — exactly the adjusted date {@link BuildOwner} stores on a
16	 * new owner. Counts existing owners whose stored {@code registrationDate} equals that business day,
17	 * so the count reflects owners registered on the same business day. Runs before {@link BuildOwner}.
